Package: rplam
Type: Package
Title: Robust estimators for Partially Linear Additive Models
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Alejandra Mercedes",
       family = "Martínez",
       role = c("aut", "cre"),
       email = "ale_m_martinez@hotmail.com")
Maintainer: The package maintainer <ale_m_martinez@hotmail.com>
Description: Robust estimation for partially linear additive models based on B-splines. The package implements a robust proposal that combines robust linear MM-regression estimators with Tukey's bisquare loss and B-spline approximations. The least-squares counterpart is also implemented. See Boente and Martínez (2023) <doi:10.1016/j.csda.2022.107611> for more details.
    The package also provides robust and least-squares estimators for additive models, that is, when the covariates enter only the nonparametric component of the model.
